EmbodiedDiag-Bench small integration

Adapted from scripts distributed by KagaKouko/diagbench on ModelScope,
revision 93a7e12e7e89459c16269d2ffc8416ab0e1be338 (2026-10-24).
The upstream dataset card declares Apache License 2.0.
Source: https://modelscope.cn/datasets/KagaKouko/diagbench/files

The Embodied-Corrector integration changes package imports and adds release
verification, progress monitoring, stricter result validation, safe resume,
service provenance and local orchestration. Original script hashes are recorded
in validation/diagbench-upstream.json. Downloaded videos and annotations retain
the rights of their respective sources and are not redistributed in this package.
